        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "23bfa65b-2e57-3e8e-988e-2446c82b0a9b",
                "word": "mérétrice",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "37d6bada-bdc8-4714-9428-a902038569b8",
                        "entry_id": "23bfa65b-2e57-3e8e-988e-2446c82b0a9b",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "mérétrices"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6fdcd257-fe1c-3721-a764-2d8cd4a19881",
                        "entry_id": "23bfa65b-2e57-3e8e-988e-2446c82b0a9b",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Femme dont la profession consiste à avoir des rapports sexuels pour de l’argent."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "43831d01-0541-4f9c-9465-da0ca8ec535a",
                                "sense_id": "6fdcd257-fe1c-3721-a764-2d8cd4a19881",
                                "text": "[…] et a en vain essayé d’éveiller son sens sexuel absent par des lectures obscènes et des relations avec des mérétrices."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "501d04d0-814b-43ab-9bf3-3f284aac0a0b",
                                "sense_id": "6fdcd257-fe1c-3721-a764-2d8cd4a19881",
                                "text": "Messer Luca pouvait bien vivre en concubinage avec Monna Tita. Elle a passé pendant quelques siècles pour une mérétrice de bas étage…"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3cba6d3d-cd6f-4345-9727-b21f30025559",
                                "sense_id": "6fdcd257-fe1c-3721-a764-2d8cd4a19881",
                                "text": "Plaute, dans sa comédie de la Cistellaria, établit clairement la différence qui existait à Rome entre la mérétrice et la prostituée : Intro ad bonam meretricem : adstare in via solum, prostibulæ sane est; c’est-à-dire: \"J’entre chez la bonne mérétrice, car c’est affaire seulement à la prostituée errante de se tenir dans la rue."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "1eb62505-5b7a-43aa-a741-1220ce4321a1",
                        "source_entry_id": "23bfa65b-2e57-3e8e-988e-2446c82b0a9b",
                        "source_sense_id": "6fdcd257-fe1c-3721-a764-2d8cd4a19881",
                        "target_lang_word": "meretrix",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "meretrix",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a720dc64-eaae-3061-bec5-38c4a4b2e02c",
                                        "entry_id": "f671a1b0-8989-3b01-9c1f-d95602a957b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A prostitute in Ancient Rome."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3fb79617-5f75-47ee-9388-dc6fe0a9f4e2",
                                                "sense_id": "a720dc64-eaae-3061-bec5-38c4a4b2e02c",
                                                "text": "Nomus Marcellus has pointed out the difference between this class of prostitutes and the prostibula. \"This is the difference between a meretrix (harlot) and a prostibula (common strumpet): a meretrix is of a more honorable station and calling; for meretrices are so named a merendo (from earning wages) because they plied their calling only by night; prostibulu because they stand before the stabulum (stall) for gain both by day and night.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfa8834b-434b-424d-b7ad-b282ca37aa38",
                                                "sense_id": "a720dc64-eaae-3061-bec5-38c4a4b2e02c",
                                                "text": "Hands grasped me like a doll, and as I dandled thus between the meretrices of Abaia, I was lifted from my broad-armed chair in the inn of Saltus; yet still, for perhaps a hundred heartbeats more, I could not rid my mind of the sea and its green-haired women."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7827dd3e-40d2-4780-96ff-fc6a294dc9ca",
                                                "sense_id": "a720dc64-eaae-3061-bec5-38c4a4b2e02c",
                                                "text": "Of the two ritually important female categories, matrona and meretrix, it was the matrona that was held at a strict ritual distance. […] The domain of the meretrix was not held at a ritual distance. The boundary between male and female was not quite so stark when the female belonged to the category of prostitute."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "14be5c6b-245f-4033-9f41-278d9c3b5b6e",
                        "source_entry_id": "23bfa65b-2e57-3e8e-988e-2446c82b0a9b",
                        "source_sense_id": "6fdcd257-fe1c-3721-a764-2d8cd4a19881",
